# `while` is one of the seven core constructs (design.md Part 5): a test block, a
# body, a back edge. Three basic blocks, and the sum of the first five squares.
# Bulk regression case.

function main()
    n: i64 @ 0
    total: i64 @ 0

    while n < 5
        total @ total + n * n
        n @ n + 1

    print(total)

    if total > 10
        print(1)
    else
        print(0)
